OL,3,GNEWSAPharmaceutical firm plans
OL,4,Aautomated warehouse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pharmaceutical firm has sought
OL,7,Fplanning permission to build a new
OL,8,Fautomated warehouse at its site.
OL,10,FB&S Group wants to build a
OL,11,Fsingle-storey warehouse extension to
OL,12,Fone of its units at Dubmire Industrial
OL,13,FEstate in Houghton-le-Spring, near
OL,14,FSunderland.
OL,16,FA planning statement said the facility
OL,17,Fwould support the firm's "continued
OL,18,Foperation and efficiency" with an
OL,19,Fautomated picking equipment and better
OL,20,Fstorage space.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
